+ * Copyright (c) 2006 Ivo van Poorten
+ * Copyright (c) 2006 Julian Hall
+ * Copyright (c) 2002-2003 Brian J. Murrell
+ *
+ * This file is part of FFmpeg.
+ *
+ * FFmpeg is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
